{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51863","headline":"鲁阳城 · 无名氏","name":"鲁阳城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豢术缘何竟醢龙，因迁僻壤隔云封。\n山迷故国芙蓉秀，水泻沙河玳瑁封。\n离黍何须发浩叹，荒城久矣属空墉。\n独怜辽鹤归何处，漫向深芊听晓钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}